  "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nCurrently, there is no way to perform server-side event search with filters such as date.\r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\r\nAdd more filters. This is a list of all filters, the ones that are already implemented are checked.\r\n\r\n+ [x] limit\r\n+ [x] not_senders\r\n+ [x] not_types\r\n+ [x] senders\r\n+ [x] types\r\n+ [x] lazy_load_members\r\n+ [x] include_redundant_members\r\n+ [x] not_rooms\r\n+ [x] rooms\r\n+ [x] contains_url\r\n+ [ ] not_date\r\n+ [ ] date\r\n+ [ ] after\r\n+ [ ] before\r\n+ [ ] mentions\r\n+ [ ] msgtypes\r\n+ [ ] not_msgtypes\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nDiscord has this:\r\n![Screenshot_20210122_171253](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/25768714/105515514-11b81c00-5cd5-11eb-8a6e-9e92ea7fe029.png)\r\n",
